    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Your Genius with Goolee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a fun way to boost your brainpower? Goolee has two exciting game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Game: Take on 20 levels of mind-bending puzzles in Easy, Medium, or Hard modes. Sharpen your skills at your own pace and challenge yourself to get smarter with each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle of the Mind: Ready to compete? Choose from 4 challenges, including a monthly showdown and the special Techlympic mode. Go head-to-head with players worldwide and climb the leaderboard to prove you\u2019re the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re solving puzzles solo or battling others, Goolee helps you unlock your true potential. Start your journey today and unleash your inner genius!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Your Genius with Goolee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a fun way to boost your brainpower? Goolee has two exciting game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Game: Take on 20 levels of mind-bending puzzles in Easy, Medium, or Hard modes. Sharpen your skills at your own pace and challenge yourself to get smarter with each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle of the Mind: Ready to compete? Choose from 4 challenges, including a monthly showdown and the special Techlympic mode. Go head-to-head with players worldwide and climb the leaderboard to prove you\u2019re the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re solving puzzles solo or battling others, Goolee helps you unlock your true potential. Start your journey today and unleash your inner genius!</p>",
